---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Feature from '../components/Feature.astro';
import Partners from '../components/Partners.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { img } from '../lib/images';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const licences = [
  {
    file: 'license-incorporation-tanzania.jpg',
    alt: 'Certificate of incorporation, Tanzania',
    caption: 'Certificate of Incorporation, Tanzania',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-registration-1.jpg',
    alt: 'Company registration, Rwanda Development Board',
    caption: 'Company registration, Rwanda',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-registration-2.jpg',
    alt: 'Business activities registration, Rwanda Development Board',
    caption: 'Business activities, Rwanda',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-uma-certificate.jpg',
    alt: 'Uganda Manufacturers Association membership certificate',
    caption: 'Uganda Manufacturers Association member',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About Us"
  description="About Petic International: a Qatari group with construction, roads, manufacturing and oil and gas operations across the Gulf States and Africa."
>
  <PageHero
    crumb="About us"
    title="About Petic International."
    lead="A Qatari group established across the Middle East and Africa, providing high-quality construction projects and engineering services in the oil and gas sector."
    image="cover-offshore-portrait.jpg"
    alt="Offshore platform at sunset"
    chip={{ title: '77+ projects', sub: 'Private and public sectors worldwide' }}
    tags={['Oil & gas', 'Construction', 'Roads', 'Manufacturing', 'Agriculture']}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
        <h2>Established worldwide, headquartered in Qatar.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Sheik Salah has been involved in global business, establishing various companies across the Middle
          East and Africa, and providing high-quality construction projects and engineering services in the
          oil and gas sector.
        </p>
        <p>
          Initially, Petic International made significant investments in the Gulf States and Tanzania,
          focusing on building infrastructure and road projects. The group then expanded to manufacturing
          household and pharmaceutical products in Rwanda, as well as gas cylinders in Uganda. Currently, the
          group is planning to represent Chinese car manufacturers by creating an assembly workshop in Africa.
        </p>
        <p>
          Petic International is a leading Qatari company specialized in the oil and gas sector, focusing on
          the manufacturing and development of spare parts and specialized equipment used in oil wells and
          various industrial operations. With a specialized team and a clear vision for sustainable growth,
          the company ensures the delivery of products and services that comply with the highest international
          industry standards.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn--navy" href={site.profile} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <Icon name="download" />
            Company profile
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">
            Contact us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split__media reveal" data-delay="1">
        <Image
          src={img('plant-pipes-blue.jpg')}
          alt="Process piping at an industrial plant"
          widths={[600, 900, 1410]}
          sizes="(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw"
        />
        <div class="split__badge">
          <b>77+</b>
          <span>projects of various sizes completed for private and public sectors worldwide.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <Feature icon="trophy" title="Projects">
          The Petic International philosophy can be put into one simple formula: can do! That is a promise we
          have been fulfilling over and over, and it will remain the highest factor guiding our actions in
          future.
        </Feature>
        <Feature icon="target" title="Mission" delay={1}>
          Oil rigs or refineries, power stations or steel mills, piping, mechanical, construction: whatever
          the project, we can develop our involvement in those areas which allow our clients to take a back
          seat, because they know that everything which is or could be important is in good hands.
        </Feature>
        <Feature icon="eye" title="Think" delay={2}>
          Only if you plan with a good degree of foresight can serious mistakes be avoided. Foresight is a
          given at Petic International.
        </Feature>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--navy">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our journey</span>
        <h2>From infrastructure to manufacturing and energy.</h2>
        <p>
          The rapid growth of the group is driven by its bold vision, strong entrepreneurial spirit and
          commitment to customer satisfaction through the delivery of excellent quality products and services.
        </p>
        <ul class="timeline mt-lg">
          <li class="reveal">
            <span class="tag">Phase one</span>
            <h3>Gulf States &amp; Tanzania</h3>
            <p>
              Significant investment in infrastructure and road projects, backed by a substantial fleet of
              mobile equipment in the Gulf States and East Africa.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" data-delay="1">
            <span class="tag">Phase two</span>
            <h3>Rwanda &amp; Uganda</h3>
            <p>
              Manufacturing of household and pharmaceutical products in Rwanda, and gas cylinders in Uganda.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" data-delay="2">
            <span class="tag">Today</span>
            <h3>Oil &amp; gas from Qatar</h3>
            <p>
              Manufacturing and development of spare parts and specialized equipment for oil wells and
              industrial operations, with services across multiple countries.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" data-delay="3">
            <span class="tag">Next</span>
            <h3>Automotive assembly in Africa</h3>
            <p>Representing Chinese car manufacturers by creating an assembly workshop in Africa.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
        <div class="side-card side-card--glass">
          <span class="eyebrow">Tanzania investment</span>
          <h3>East Trading &amp; Manufacturing Company LTD</h3>
          <p class="text-gold">{site.tanzaniaAddress}</p>
          <p>
            East Trading &amp; Manufacturing Company has been established in Tanzania to provide quality
            construction services to real estate contractors, construction companies, and the civil
            engineering and infrastructure industries. The company has built a successful track record based
            on its commitment to customers in the operations and construction domain.
          </p>
          <p>
            With extensive experience in building services, East Trading Company is moving forward to
            undertake complex and challenging civil engineering and building projects, extending its services
            from innovative technical concepts and front-end engineering design to long-term goals in
            construction management, including the installation, commissioning and long-term operation
            maintenance of projects in the construction sector.
          </p>
          <p>
            The company holds a portfolio of strategic investments in the construction sector, owning a
            substantial fleet of mobile equipment in the Gulf States and the East Africa region, which
            complements the company’s multi-domestic growth strategy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split split--rev">
      <div class="split__media reveal">
        <Image
          src={img('offshore-walkway.jpg')}
          alt="Walkway on an offshore platform"
          widths={[600, 900, 1224]}
          sizes="(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span>
        <h2>Contributing to the development of the Gulf States and Africa.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Our mission is to participate in and contribute to the development and enrichment of services in the
          Gulf States and the East Africa region. We aim to provide solutions for various communities in the
          construction sector by offering high-quality engineering services.
        </p>
        <p>
          The company is fully committed to looking after the interests of its customers, employees,
          shareholders and communities, conducting its business ethically and profitably as a responsible
          corporate citizen. To accomplish our mission, we continually:
        </p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Enhance our competencies by leveraging the skills of qualified engineering professionals,
              fostering effective communication at all levels to improve the operating environment.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Expand our presence in existing markets through fair pricing, meeting deadlines, providing
              quality products and value-driven solutions, and offering high-quality service through advanced
              and creative technological approaches.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Energize our employees by promoting a culture that recognizes performance, values contributions
              and celebrates successes.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our licences</span>
        <h2>Registered, certified and accountable.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Certificates of incorporation, registrations and memberships held by the group’s companies in East
          Africa.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery reveal">
        {licences.map((l) => (
          <figure>
            <Image
              src={img(l.file)}
              alt={l.alt}
              class="gallery__doc"
              widths={[400, 800]}
              sizes="(min-width: 760px) 25vw, 50vw"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <figcaption>{l.caption}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Partners title="Trusted by global brands." />
  <Cta />
</Base>
